</svg>
</div>
<div style="flex: 1 1 520px; min-width: 0">
<p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #FFA5FF">The opinionated, batteries-included CMS</p>
<p class="mp-serif mp-lead" style="margin: 0; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.22; color: #F7F0F5">Moonpuck is an open source CMS built on Cloudflare: one Worker, with your content in D1 and your files in R2, on your own account. Nothing to host, nothing to patch.</p>
<p class="mp-serif mp-lead" style="margin: 26px 0 0; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.22; color: #F7F0F5">A visual editor, events and tickets, members, mailing lists, donations, a shop and Claude come with it. Turn on what you need.</p>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 40px">
<a href="/docs/local-setup/" class="mp-pill" style="background: #F5D8EF; color: #120C1F">Get started</a>
<a href="#features" class="mp-pill" style="background: #1B2A6B; color: #DCD8FF">See what's included</a>
<a href="#build" class="mp-pill" style="border: 2px solid #F7F0F5; color: #F7F0F5">Have us build it</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="mp-pillars">
<div class="mp-pillar">
<p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; color: #FFA5FF">Built on Cloudflare</p>
<p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">A Worker with D1 and R2. Pages are cached at the edge, images resized for you, mail and jobs handled by the platform. No servers, no database to run.</p>
</div>
<div class="mp-pillar">
<p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; color: #FFA5FF">Batteries included</p>
<p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">What a small organization runs on is already in the box and works together: one place for members, tickets, orders and mail. No plugins to choose or keep up to date.</p>
</div>
<div class="mp-pillar">
<p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; color: #FFA5FF">Opinionated</p>
<p style="margin: 10px 0 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">One good way to do each thing: content as blocks, the look as theme settings, an accessibility check before publishing, and core updates you merge in with git.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section id="features" style="background: #9898FF; padding: 104px 0 112px">
<div class="mp-wrap">
<p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #120C1F">Batteries included</p>
<h2 class="mp-serif mp-h2" style="margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: 80px; line-height: 1; color: #120C1F">Everything in one orbit</h2>
<p style="margin: 0 0 48px; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 620px">What a small organization runs on, built in and working together. Turn on what you need under Settings: nothing to install, no plugins to keep up to date.</p>
<div class="mp-cards">
<a href="#compose" class="mp-card" style="background: #C83C1F; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Editing</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Compose with Claude</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Pages, events, forms and campaigns built from your documents and photos.</p></a>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #C5E975"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Editing</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Visual editor</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Edit on the page. Templates, patterns, autosave and revisions.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FEA903"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Editing</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Media library</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Focal points per screen size, AVIF and WebP, alt text written for you.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #2F5BD6; color: #FFFFFF"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Forms</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Forms and payments</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Conditional fields, Stripe or Square, designed notification emails.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FDF152"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Events</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Events calendar</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Recurring events, venues, month and day views, calendar feeds.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FF542F"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Events</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Tickets</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Paid or free, with waitlists, check-in, refunds and reminder emails.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #F5D8EF"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">People</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Members</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Levels, sign-ups, members-only pages and member prices.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #C5E975"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">People</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Mailing lists</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Campaigns, segments and a weekly digest of what's new.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FEA903"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Giving</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Donations</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">One-time and monthly gifts, receipts, fundraising goals with a progress bar.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FFA5FF"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Selling</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Shop</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Products with options and stock, a cart, member prices and members-only products.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #2F5BD6; color: #FFFFFF"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Selling</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Shipping and tax</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Your own zones and rates, pickup locations, tax rates or Stripe Tax.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FDF152"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Insight</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Stats without cookies</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Views, visitors, clicks and campaigns. No banner needed.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #C5E975"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Insight</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Search and SEO</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Live site search, search titles and share images, written for you.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FEA903"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Care</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Accessibility check</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Problems flagged in the editor, and optionally held before publishing.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #F5D8EF"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Care</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Popups and consent</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Dialogs and bars from your own blocks, and a cookie banner that holds cookie-based tracking until people agree.</p></div>
<div class="mp-card" style="background: #FDF152"><p class="mp-label" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px">Care</p><h3 class="mp-serif" style="margin: 8px 0 8px; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.05">Redirects</h3><p style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">Moved pages redirect themselves. Missing addresses are logged.</p></div>
